OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,8,     Fincluding music by Respighi plus
OL,9,     Fpiano music by Rachmaninoff from
OL,10,     Fthe Aldeburgh Festival and cello
OL,11,     Fmusic from Spain.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,13,     F1/5. Donald Macleod journeys
OL,14,     Fthrough the early years of Alice
OL,15,     FMary Smith, with guests Ian
OL,16,     FGraham-Jones and Leanne Langley.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FKatie Derham talks to conductor
OL,19,     FOmer Meir Wellber ahead of his BBC
OL,20,     FProm, and Oxford Piano Festival
OL,21,     Fartist Rustem Hayroudinoff
OL,22,     Fperforms live in the studio.
