OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto presents highlights from
OL,7,     Fthis year's Jazzahead in Bremen,
OL,8,     FGermany. Tonight, we hear from
OL,9,     Ftrombonist Nabou Claerhout and a
OL,10,     Flive track from her set.
OL,11,G0030 Through the Night
OL,12,     FOle Edvard Antonsen delivers
OL,13,     FTrumpet Concertos by Haydn and
OL,14,     FTartini. He's accompanied by the
OL,15,     FArgovia Philharmonic conducted by
OL,16,     FRune Bergmann.
